*> Test of 33 section 2, Level tick order (core/src/worldsim-33.cob; T0501): the steps behind the tick manager, the empty-level counter and entity phase, the chunk loop decisions, randomBlockPos and the random tick counts.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-WORLDSIM-33-2.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY INTERACT.
